# Build / packaging artifacts
# build/ is where `zip` writes the upload package. It lives inside the repo so
# the artefact sits beside the source it was built from, and it is ignored so a
# stale package can never be committed and mistaken for the real one.
build/
*.zip
*.crx
*.pem

